<Guest title="WiFi & Smart Home">
  <p>Stay connected and use the smart home features.</p>

  <h2>WiFi</h2>

  <div class="g-callout">
    <p>The WiFi network name and password are on the refrigerator and on the signs in the kitchens.</p>
  </div>

  <h3>About the Connection</h3>
  <ul>
    <li>Strong signal throughout the house</li>
    <li>Suitable for 4K streaming, video calls, and remote work</li>
    <li>Please don't touch the router. If WiFi isn't working, contact Suncadia</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Smart Thermostat</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Device:</strong> Google Nest thermostat</li>
    <li><strong>Location:</strong> 2nd floor</li>
    <li>Adjust it directly on the thermostat</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Don'ts</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Don't reset any smart devices to factory settings</li>
    <li>Don't touch, unplug, or restart the router</li>
    <li>Don't change WiFi network settings</li>
    <li>Don't share the WiFi password publicly</li>
    <li>Don't move or unplug smart home devices</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Troubleshooting</h2>

  <h3>WiFi not working?</h3>
  <ul>
    <li>Check if other devices can connect</li>
    <li>Restart your device</li>
    <li>Contact Suncadia if issues persist</li>
  </ul>

  <p style="margin-top: 32px;">Need help? See <a href="/guest/contacts">Contacts</a>.</p>
</Guest>
